01:03:31,764 --> 01:03:37,764
Wolfs is a 2024 American action comedy film written and directed by Jon Watts.

11
01:09:52,941 --> 01:09:58,941
Starring George Clooney, Brad Pitt, and Austin Abrams, it follows two nameless, professional fixers who
are forced to work together on a job despite their preference to operate as lone wolves.

12
01:16:14,117 --> 01:16:20,117
Wolfs premiered out of competition at the Venice International Film
Festival on September 1, 2024, to lukewarm reviews.

13
01:22:35,294 --> 01:22:41,294
It had a one-week limited theatrical release starting on September 20, 2024, it received mixed reviews from critics,
and was released a week after on Apple TV+, where it became the streaming service's most-viewed film.

14
01:28:56,470 --> 01:29:02,470
Apple's decision to pivot the film to streaming despite pre-arranged agreements for a theatrical release led Watts not to move forward with a planned
sequel.However, Sony Pictures (through Columbia Pictures) retains the distribution rights to the film for its Video on-demand release.

15
01:35:17,647 --> 01:35:23,647
The film explores themes of hotel room, dark
comedy, lone wolf, drugs, buddy comedy.

16
01:41:38,823 --> 01:41:44,823
The tone is lighthearted and dark.
